  "experimental_conditions": {
    "001": {
      "0": {
        "facility": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(ACCEL,1USANOT)",
            "free_txt": [
              " The University of Notre Dame 5U",
              "accelerator."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "inc-spect": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "A beam of protons with center-of-mass energies",
              "between 1.5 and 4.5 MeV was impinged upon a target of",
              "isotopically enriched 94Mo. The beam current ranged",
              "from 5-900 nA and was increased at lower beam",
              "energies to compensate for the decreasing reaction",
              "cross section. The uncertainty in the center-of-mass",
              "energy comes from a combination of the uncertainty in",
              "the beam energy resolution and the energy loss",
              "through the target. The beam resolution from the 5U",
              "has an uncertainty of 1-2 keV and the energy loss",
              "through the targets ranged between 20 and 60 keV."
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "002": {
      "0": {
        "detector": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(NAICR)",
            "free_txt": [
              " The targets were placed in the center of the",
              "high efficiency total absorption spectrometer",
              " (HECTOR). HECTOR is composed of 16 NaI(Tl) segments",
              "each read by two photomultiplier tubes. These",
              "segments are arranged to cover nearly the entirety of",
              "the 4pi solid angle."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "err-analys": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(ERR-T)",
            "free_txt": [
              " Total uncertainties."
            ]
          },
          {
            "x4_code": "(ERR-S,,10.)",
            "free_txt": [
              " Statistical uncertainty."
            ]
          },
          {
            "x4_code": "(ERR-1)",
            "free_txt": [
              " The number of beam particles."
            ]
          },
          {
            "x4_code": "(ERR-2)",
            "free_txt": [
              " Dead time."
            ]
          },
          {
            "x4_code": "(ERR-3,5.,20.)",
            "free_txt": [
              " The relative uncertainty of the",
              "summing efficiency was around 5% for the standard",
              "analysis runs and around 20% for the runs analyzed",
              "using the filter."
            ]
          },
          {
            "x4_code": "(ERR-4)",
            "free_txt": [
              " Target thickness."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "method": [
          {
            "x4_code": null,
            "free_txt": [
              "The cross section was measured using the",
              "gamma-summing technique. When the 95Tc that was",
              "produced in the reaction deexcites to the ground",
              "state, a cascade of gamma rays is emitted. In the",
              "gamma-summing technique all of the gamma rays emitted",
              "in the cascade are summed up to give the total amount",
              "of energy detected during that event."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "sample": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(42-MO-94,ENR=0.9899)",
            "free_txt": [
              " The 94Mo target, 588(66)",
              "microg/cm2 thick with 98.99% enrichment, was made by",
              "evaporation onto a gold backing. The gold backing, 96",
              "mg/cm2, was used to stop the beam at the target",
              "location to reduce the background contaminants from",
              "beam straggling, in particular fluorine that may be",
              "present in the beam-pipe components. The thickness of",
              "the target was verified using x-ray fluorescence."
            ]
          }
        ],
        "status": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(TABLE,,R.Kelmar+,J,PR/C,109,035805,2024)",
            "free_txt": [
              " Table - I"
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "003": {
      "0": {
        "err-analys": [
          {
            "x4_code": "(DATA-ERR)",
            "free_txt": [
              " The uncertainty of the reaction rate was",
              "obtained by performing a Monte Carlo technique. The",
              "cross-section values were randomly sampled from a",
              "Gaussian distribution with the mean and standard",
              "deviation from the measured point and then the",
              "integral was computed. This process was repeated 100",
              "000 times to obtain a probability distribution for",
              "the true value of the reaction rate at each",
              "temperature."
            ]
          }
        ],
